From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Subject: [PATCH] Scheduler: join a run queue at most one slice ahead of its v

Each CPU has its own virtual time v, and they drift far apart. A woken
context kept vtime.max(v), so one that last ran on a busier CPU arrived far
ahead of a quiet CPU v; v = ineligible_min_vtime and work stealing (own v
plus the gap to the other queue) then pushed v and vtime up step by step
until they wrapped past u64::MAX, and a runnable context was never picked.
On wakeup and when stolen, clamp vtime to at most one slice ahead of the
queue v.
---
diff -ruN a/src/context/switch.rs b/src/context/switch.rs
--- a/src/context/switch.rs	2026-11-01 09:07:01.512266225 +0000
+++ b/src/context/switch.rs	2026-11-01 09:07:01.521063630 +0000
@@ -397,6 +397,14 @@
                 let weight = SCHED_PRIO_TO_WEIGHT[guard.prio] as u64;
                 let scaled_slice = (BASE_SLICE_TICKS as u128 * SCALE) / weight as u128;
 
+                // Join this queue at most one slice ahead of its v. v differs a
+                // lot between CPUs, so a context that last ran on a busier CPU
+                // would otherwise arrive far ahead; `v = ineligible_min_vtime`
+                // and work stealing then push v and vtime up step by step until
+                // they wrap past u64::MAX, and the context is never picked.
+                let new_vtime = new_vtime.min(run_queue.v.saturating_add(scaled_slice as u64));
+                guard.vtime = new_vtime;
+
                 if !guard.is_active {
                     guard.is_active = true;
                     run_queue.total_weight += weight;
@@ -870,6 +878,15 @@
                     let scaled_slice = guard.rem_slice / weight;
                     guard.vd = guard.vtime.saturating_add(scaled_slice);
 
+                    // As on wakeup: join at most one slice ahead of this queue's v.
+                    let max_vtime = contexts_data
+                        .v
+                        .saturating_add(((BASE_SLICE_TICKS as u128 * SCALE) / weight as u128) as u64);
+                    if guard.vtime > max_vtime {
+                        guard.vtime = max_vtime;
+                        guard.vd = guard.vtime.saturating_add(scaled_slice);
+                    }
+
                     if final_winner.is_none() && !prev_runnable {
                         final_winner = Some((guard, addr_space));
                     } else {
